<title>BAHRAIN: Islamic Development Bank to lend Albania $12.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Islamic Development Bank to lend Albania $12.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Islamic Development Bank (IDB) said on Monday it would extend a $12.5 million loan to Albania under two agreements signed at its headquarters in Jeddah.</p>
<p>An IDB statement said the loan would be used to finance water and agricultural projects in Albania.</p>
<p>It said the facility raised total financing provided by the bank to Albania to around $30 million since Albania joined the IDB in November 1992.</p>
</text>
